          {
            "title": "Question: Any number",
            "id": 73310,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é o número máximo de valores que um array pode conter?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Quantos quisermos</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">10</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Quantos quisermos.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um array de playlist passa de 3 para 12 músicas. O mesmo array pode armazenar todas as 12?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sim, um array pode armazenar quantos valores forem necessários</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não, um array pode armazenar apenas um valor</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Não, um array deixa de aceitar valores depois do décimo</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Sim, mas apenas depois de substituir as três músicas originais</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sim, um array pode armazenar quantos valores forem necessários.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Element",
            "id": 73903,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que é um elemento?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Um valor em um array</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Um array</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A condição de um array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Um valor em um array.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Em <code>const scores = [8, 10, 9]</code>, qual opção é um elemento?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O valor <code>10</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">O array inteiro <code>[8, 10, 9]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">O índice usado para encontrar <code>10</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">O nome da variável <code>scores</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher O valor <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Value in an array",
            "id": 73269,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Atribua um array com o valor <code>\"Feed Clawdius\"</code> à variável <code>toDo</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Feed Clawdius&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;To Do:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\",\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Feed Darian&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"To Do:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"[ 'Feed Clawdius' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>[</code> seguido de <code>\"Feed Clawdius\"</code> e finalmente <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Square brackets",
            "id": 73271,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crie um array armazenando <code>\"classic\"</code> e <code>\"dark mode\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" themes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;classic&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dark mode&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(themes);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'classic', 'dark mode' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>[</code> seguido de <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crie um array armazenando <code>\"classic\"</code> e <code>\"dark mode\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" themes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;classic&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dark mode&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(themes);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"theme\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"styles\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"modes\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'classic', 'dark mode' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>themes</code> seguido de <code>[</code> e finalmente <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Empty array",
            "id": 73313,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shoppingList = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(shoppingList);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[ \"\" ]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[ shoppingList ]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>[]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Imagine que você adicione <code>\"milk\"</code> com <code>.push()</code> antes de exibir o array. O que o console mostraria?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shoppingList = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(shoppingList);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[ \"milk\" ]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[ \"\", \"milk\" ]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>[ \"milk\" ]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Start at zero",
            "id": 73926,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é o índice de <code>\"lightBlue\"</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" colorScheme = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;lightBlue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;grey&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>-1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual expressão obtém <code>\"lightBlue\"</code> de <code>colorScheme</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" colorScheme = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;lightBlue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;orange&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;grey&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>colorScheme[0]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>colorScheme[1]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>colorScheme[-1]</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>colorScheme(0)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>colorScheme[0]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Change value",
            "id": 73974,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Atualize o segundo elemento para <code>\"Lee\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" missedCalls = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Lou&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Zoe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"missedCalls[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(missedCalls);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"missedCalls[2]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Robert&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"58\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Lou', 'Lee' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>missedCalls[1]</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e finalmente <code>\"Lee\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Valid index",
            "id": 73931,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é o último índice que podemos acessar neste array?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ordersDelivered = [\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O array tem três valores de entrega, e a indexação começa em <code>0</code>. Qual é o último índice válido?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ordersDelivered = [\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code>, o índice do terceiro valor</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code>, porque o array tem três valores</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code>, porque o último valor é <code>true</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code>, porque apenas os valores <code>false</code> contam</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>2</code>, o índice do terceiro valor.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Start at zero",
            "id": 73980,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Código <code>\"Meg\"</code> no índice <code>0</code> e <code>\"Max\"</code> no índice <code>1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Meg&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Max&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(players);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Meg', 'Max' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>\"Meg\"</code> seguido de <code>\"Max\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Código <code>\"Meg\"</code> no índice <code>0</code> e <code>\"Max\"</code> no índice <code>1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Meg&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Max&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(players);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"push\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"shift\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'Meg', 'Max' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>\"Meg\"</code> seguido de <code>\"Max\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Access element",
            "id": 73925,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como acessamos o valor <code>22</code> neste array?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bingoAnswer = [\" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"22\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>bingoAnswer[2]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>bingoAnswer[3]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>bingoAnswer(2)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>bingoAnswer[2]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O valor <code>22</code> é o terceiro em <code>bingoAnswer</code>. Qual expressão o obtém?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bingoAnswer = [\" /><text value=\"16\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"22\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>bingoAnswer[2]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>bingoAnswer[3]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>bingoAnswer(2)</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>bingoAnswer[22]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>bingoAnswer[2]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Pop",
            "id": 74092,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que <code>.pop()</code> faz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Remove o último valor de um array</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Remove o primeiro valor de um array</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Remove um valor aleatório de um array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Remove o último valor de um array.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Você chama <code>tasks.pop()</code> em <code>[\"email\", \"call\", \"meeting\"]</code>. O que acontece?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ele remove e retorna <code>\"meeting\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ele remove e retorna <code>\"email\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ele remove uma das três tarefas aleatoriamente</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Ele retorna <code>3</code> e mantém as três tarefas</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ele remove e retorna <code>\"meeting\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Push",
            "id": 74095,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que <code>.push()</code> faz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Adiciona um valor a um array</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Remove um valor de um array</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ele cria um array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Adiciona um valor a um array.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Depois de <code>forecast.push(\"windy\")</code>, o que acontece com <code>[\"sunny\", \"cloudy\"]</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ele se torna <code>[\"sunny\", \"cloudy\", \"windy\"]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ele se torna <code>[\"sunny\", \"windy\"]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ele cria um array separado <code>[\"windy\"]</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Ele se torna <code>[\"windy\", \"sunny\", \"cloudy\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ele se torna <code>[\"sunny\", \"cloudy\", \"windy\"]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Push",
            "id": 74090,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicione <code>\"windy\"</code> a este array de previsão do tempo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" forecast = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sunny&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;cloudy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"forecast.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;windy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(forecast);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;rainy&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'sunny', 'cloudy', 'windy' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>forecast</code> seguido de <code>.</code> e depois <code>push</code>, <code>\"windy\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: End of the array",
            "id": 74094,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é o índice de <code>\"salami\"</code> no array, após adicioná-lo com <code>push()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toppings = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;mozarella&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toppings.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;salami&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toppings);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[ 'mozarella', 'salami' ]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Depois do <code>push()</code> exibido, qual índice obteria <code>\"salami\"</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toppings = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;mozarella&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toppings.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;salami&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toppings);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[ 'mozarella', 'salami' ]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>toppings.push[1]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Store removed element",
            "id": 74091,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é o valor de <code>digit</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" doorCode = [\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" digit = doorCode.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(digit);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Depois do <code>pop()</code> exibido, qual resultado descreve <code>digit</code> e <code>doorCode</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" doorCode = [\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" digit = doorCode.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(digit);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">digit é 1, e doorCode é [2, 5, 0, 0]</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">digit é 1, e doorCode é [2, 5, 0, 0, 1]</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">digit é 1, e doorCode é [5, 0, 0, 1]</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">digit é 0, e doorCode é [2, 5, 0, 1]</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">digit é 1, e doorCode é [2, 5, 0, 0].</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
