            "title": "Popping",
            "id": 53007,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este trecho de código vai exibir no console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" family = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frank&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Monica&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Fiona&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lip&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"family.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"family.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(family.length);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"6\" correct=\"false\"><code>4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Depois das duas chamadas a <code>pop()</code>, quais nomes permanecem e qual comprimento é registrado?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" family = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frank&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Monica&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Fiona&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lip&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"family.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"family.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(family.length);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Frank e Monica permanecem, e <code>2</code> é registrado</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Frank, Monica e Fiona permanecem, e <code>3</code> é registrado</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Os quatro nomes permanecem, e <code>4</code> é registrado</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Fiona e Lip permanecem, e <code>2</code> é registrado</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Frank e Monica permanecem, e <code>2</code> é registrado.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Pushing",
            "id": 53009,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este trecho de código vai exibir no console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" purse = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;wallet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;phone&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;keys&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"purse.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"purse.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;tablet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(purse);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[&quot;wallet&quot;, &quot;phone&quot;, &quot;keys&quot;, &quot;apple&quot;, &quot;tablet&quot;]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[\"wallet\", \"phone\", \"keys\", \"apple\", \"tablet\"]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"wallet\", \"phone\", \"keys\", \"apple\"]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">5</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>[\"wallet\", \"phone\", \"keys\", \"apple\", \"tablet\"]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>As duas chamadas a <code>push()</code> são executadas em ordem. O que o registro de <code>purse</code> exibe?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" purse = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;wallet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;phone&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;keys&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"purse.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"purse.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;tablet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(purse);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[&quot;wallet&quot;, &quot;phone&quot;, &quot;keys&quot;, &quot;apple&quot;, &quot;tablet&quot;]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[\"wallet\", \"phone\", \"keys\", \"apple\", \"tablet\"]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"wallet\", \"phone\", \"keys\", \"apple\"]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>5</code>, a quantidade final de valores</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"tablet\", \"apple\", \"wallet\", \"phone\", \"keys\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>[\"wallet\", \"phone\", \"keys\", \"apple\", \"tablet\"]</code>.</p></body></html>"
